                                            &lt;/li&gt;=0A                       =
                                         &lt;li&gt;=0A                           =
                                         &lt;p&gt;Then, download the printer driv=
er from the official page.=0A                                              =
                      &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                              =
                  &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                 =
               &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                     =
               &lt;p&gt;Next, double-tap the downloaded file.&lt;/p&gt;=0A             =
                                                   &lt;/li&gt;=0A                =
                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A                    =
                                                &lt;p&gt;Now, you have to complet=
e the installation steps.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                           =
                     &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                              =
                  &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                  =
                  &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key + R.&lt;/p&gt;=0A      =
                                                          &lt;/li&gt;=0A         =
                                                       &lt;li&gt;=0A             =
                                                       &lt;p&gt;Next, the Run dia=
logue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                =
                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                   =
             &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                       =
             &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.DevicesAndPrinte=
rs.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                            =
        &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                            =
    &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                               =
 &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                   =
 &lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                =
                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                   =
                             &lt;li&gt;=0A                                       =
                             &lt;p&gt;Then, the Devices and Printers folder will =
open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                               =
 &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;l=
i&gt;=0A                                                                    &lt;p=
&gt;Next, your screen will display the Add Printer option.=0A                 =
                                                   &lt;/p&gt;=0A                 =
                                               &lt;/li&gt;=0A                    =
                                            &lt;li&gt;=0A                        =
                                            &lt;p&gt;Click the Add Printer button=
 and follow the prompts.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                            =
                    &lt;/li&gt;=0A=0A                                            =
                &lt;/ul&gt;=0A                                                   =
     &lt;/div&gt;=0A=0A                                                        &lt;d=
iv class=3D&quot;shadow cardbackgroundcolor p-3 my-3 setformac&quot;&gt;=0A             =
                                               &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;mt-2 my-3 text-=
primary&quot;&gt;Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A                              =
                              &lt;ul class=3D&quot;scannerissuelisting p-0&quot;&gt;=0A    =
                                                            &lt;li&gt;=0A        =
                                                            &lt;p&gt;Firstly, you=
 will need to turn on the Mac device and=0A                                =
                                        printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                    =
                                            &lt;/li&gt;=0A                       =
                                         &lt;li&gt;=0A                           =
                                         &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the printer to th=
e wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                 =
               &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                    =
            &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                        =
            &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the printer=0A    =
                                                                    driver.=
&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;/li=
&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A=
                                                                    &lt;p&gt;Then=
, complete the driver installation process.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                         =
                                       &lt;/li&gt;=0A                            =
                                    &lt;li&gt;=0A                                =
                                    &lt;p&gt;After that, go to the Apple Menu.&lt;/p=
&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;/li&gt;=
=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A =
                                                                   &lt;p&gt;In th=
e menu, you have to click the System and Preferences=0A                    =
                                                    option.&lt;/p&gt;=0A         =
                                                       &lt;/li&gt;=0A            =
